st of the game."}, {"turn": 31, "text": "Both sides prefer C9 here, and both miss it. Opus 5.5's H5 lost 5.9 points (-5.8 to -11.7), and the 14k's H6 gave the same 5.9 back. The right-hand fight was a long trade of 4 to 6 point errors that left the gap where it started."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py only parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberty count, and count.py only counts stones plus enclosed territory with named dead stones removed. Both work on the current position, and neither one picks, scores or ranks candidate moves or looks ahead.", "stop": false}}